TI  - The (Hour)glass Half-Full: Modified Silicone Hourglass Stents for the Treatment 
      of Central Airway Obstruction.
PG  - e15501
LID - 10.7759/cureus.15501 [doi]
LID - e15501
AB  - Central airway obstruction often presents with airway narrowing of differing 
      internal diameters. Conventional straight stents do not fit these airways well 
      and are prone to migration. We present a series of cases where hourglass-shaped 
      silicone stents were customized intra-operatively to fit airway obstructions of 
      both malignant and non-malignant etiologies and to improve patient performance 
      status. Modified hourglass stents are a versatile tool to manage inoperable 
      airway obstruction with unique anatomical characteristics.
